    Note over CS,CSMS: 2. Execute Reusable State EVDisconnected

    Note over CS,CSMS: 3. Execute Reusable State EnergyTransferStarted<br>Note: New transaction will use seqNo 0 for the first TransactionEventRequest
    Note over CSMS: Validation: CSMS accepts the message TransactionEventRequest<br>with eventType = Started and seqNo = 0<br>and answers with a TransactionEventResponse message

    Note over CS,CSMS: 4. Execute Reusable State EVDisconnected

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validations: N/a
